### Main Endpoints

#### 🤖 Chat with Safety Protection
```bash
POST /chat
```

**Request:**
```json
{
  "message": "Hello, how are you?",
  "model": "{{ model_default }}",
  "max_tokens": 150,
  "temperature": 0.7
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "response": "Hello! I'm doing well, thank you for asking...",
  "blocked": false,
  "block_reason": null,
  "safety_scores": {
    "toxicity": {"blocked": false, "confidence": 0.1},
    "pii": {"blocked": false, "confidence": 0.0}
  },
  "model_used": "{{ model_default }}",
  "processing_time": 1.234
}
```

#### 🛡️ Safety Check Only
```bash
POST /safety-check
```

**Request:**
```json
{
  "text": "Check this text for safety issues",
  "detectors": ["toxicity", "pii"]
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "blocked": false,
  "results": {
    "toxicity": {"blocked": false, "confidence": 0.1, "reason": null},
    "pii": {"blocked": false, "confidence": 0.0, "reason": null}
  },
  "overall_confidence": 0.1,
  "processing_time": 0.456
}
```

#### 🏥 Health Check
```bash
GET /health
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "healthy",
  "detectors_loaded": {{ detectors|length }},
  "llm_provider": "{{ llm_provider }}",
  "models_available": ["{{ model_default }}"],
  "uptime": 3600.0
}
```

#### 📋 List Detectors
```bash
GET /detectors
```

#### 🤖 List Models
```bash
GET /models
```

